 which shows the average number of steps per day in a one-month period.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/de535d589204fce38a55acfb5c869c3e/charts-dynamic-range-axis-large%402x.png","line":72,"embedded":true},{"title":"Descriptive content","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Descriptive-content","line":80},{"title":"An illustration of the rain forecast for the next hour in the Weather app, which uses succinct, plain language to describe the expected precipitation.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/28ee38d191d2f9816ded3e735bfee4a7/charts-descriptive-content%402x.png","line":86,"embedded":true},{"title":"Best practices","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Best-practices","line":88},{"title":"Enhancing the accessibility of a chart","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Enhancing-the-accessibility-of-a-chart","line":94},{"title":"Audio graphs","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Accessibility/audio-graphs","line":94},{"title":"Vision","target":"https://www.apple.com/accessibility/vision/","line":94},{"title":"Accessibility","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/accessibility","line":100},{"title":"`accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(_:)`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/View/accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction\\(_:\\","line":100},{"title":"`NSAccessibility.Notification`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSAccessibility-swift.struct/Notification","line":102},{"title":"`UIAccessibility.Notification`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIAccessibility/Notification","line":102},{"title":"Color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Color","line":106},{"title":"Inclusive color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/color#Inclusive-color","line":108},{"title":"An illustration of a blood pressure chart in the Health app that uses a red circle to represent systolic values and a black or white diamond to represent diastolic values.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/47d2a6b70d030b1aa595826248cb1186/charts-colors%402x.png","line":112,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of iPhone Storage Settings, which uses a single bar mark containing several segments of different colors to show the relative space taken by items such as music, apps, and photos. The bar includes a narrow strip of empty space between each pair of segments.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/86da90aecee27935b14e2b48388d08a6/charts-colors-stacked%402x.png","line":116,"embedded":true},{"title":"Enhancing the accessibility of a chart","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Enhancing-the-accessibility-of-a-chart","line":118},{"title":"Audio graphs","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Accessibility/audio-graphs","line":120},{"title":"An illustration of a chart in Maps that shows the range of elevations over the total distance of the trip. A VoiceOver focus indicator is visible on top of the chart, containing approximately one-fifth of the total distance and elevation.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/b85d8add4c38b6bedd65caf24fdbe03a/charts-bar-chart-with-voiceover-focus%402x.png","line":130,"embedded":true},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Platform-considerations","line":149},{"title":"watchOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#watchOS","line":153},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/charts#Resources","line":157},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/hum